WEBVTT

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:16.980
The Royal Order and the Ecclesiastical Order
have come to blows?

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:19.980
Squad 4, and even Olivier's forces,

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:24.020
are said to have taken up arms
to rescue a single witch.

00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:25.600
Witch?

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:27.400
Princess Marielle.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:28.440
Huh?

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:33.020
Adelheid has mobilized her troops.
Nothing else makes sense.

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:34.900
Rugis...

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:36.150
The time is ripe.

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:40.940
A turning point in the Kingdom
of Hortensia's history is upon us.

00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:46.230
November 10, 771, New Holy Era

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:51.400
As word of Princess Marielle being alive
spreads through the kingdom,

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:53.400
anti-church faction members

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:56.270
are starting to rise in revolt,
one after the next.

00:00:56.270 --> 00:00:57.980
In light of the situation,

00:00:57.980 --> 00:01:01.480
our castle has become the new
stronghold for the princess faction--

00:01:01.480 --> 00:01:04.600
those of us who recognize Princess Marielle.

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:06.020
We want you gentlemen

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:10.150
to spread the word to our anti-church
comrades throughout the kingdom--

00:01:10.150 --> 00:01:12.520
Assemble in Oliver!

00:01:12.520 --> 00:01:13.520
Ma'am!

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:19.310
All right, we should send to Albert
for the princess at once.

00:01:19.310 --> 00:01:22.770
Yes. But before we do...

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.940
Hmm? What is it?

00:01:24.940 --> 00:01:28.900
In order for us to win this war,

00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:32.060
it's going to take more than
just sovereign authority.

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:38.100
I have to size her up at once--

00:01:40.650 --> 00:01:43.980
Marielle Le Hortensia.

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:18.850
In you go...

00:03:21.060 --> 00:03:25.020
I cannot believe everyone is already heading out again.

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:28.230
But this time...

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:36.480
Deflotte, what is the matter?

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:40.650
Oh, you know. Nonnoria, are you busy packing?

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:42.940
Hmm? What's wrong? You seem down.

00:03:44.650 --> 00:03:49.900
Oh! Do you have any idea how much
I have been worried for all of you?!

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:51.730
Oh, sorry.

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:54.810
When you were all taken prisoner,

00:03:54.810 --> 00:03:58.190
I was overjoyed when you all came back safely.

00:03:58.190 --> 00:04:02.150
But now you are off to yet another great battle.

00:04:02.150 --> 00:04:04.850
Not to mention finding out
that Marius is actually a girl,

00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:08.270
and a princess at that! I...

00:04:08.270 --> 00:04:11.690
I know what you mean!
I feel all sorts of uncomfortable around her!

00:04:11.690 --> 00:04:15.730
That's because you haven't owned up to it yet.

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:13.900
Wha--?

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:16.770
Pops...!

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:19.600
Princess Marielle,

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:23.600
we must wait here in Albert
until word arrives from Adelheid.

00:04:26.230 --> 00:04:28.270
Princess, is something troubling you?

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:32.150
Do you find yourself not feeling well?

00:04:32.150 --> 00:04:35.310
N-No, that's not it.

00:04:35.310 --> 00:04:39.770
It's just... I just can't get used
to being called "Princess."

00:04:39.770 --> 00:04:42.100
But Your Highness, you are the princess.

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:44.560
Before long, the people will
address you as such, as well.

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:46.850
No, that's not what I'm talking about!

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:47.810
Huh?

00:04:47.810 --> 00:04:51.980
It's not the people, it's <i>you</i> calling me
"Princess" that's putting me off!

00:04:51.980 --> 00:04:54.230
Oh, I, er...

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:58.560
Ah, I've had it! This is just going to keep annoying me!

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:03.440
Alfred, call me "Marius," like you did before!

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:08.190
Huh? No, that would be far too great
an affront to a princess...

00:05:08.190 --> 00:05:10.900
Just do it! And stop talking so politely! Understood?

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:12.900
No, I could not possibly--

00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:15.940
I'm telling you, you don't have to worry about it!

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:19.400
Come on, Deflotte, give up already!

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:20.940
All right, I get it!

00:05:23.980 --> 00:05:29.730
Um, Princess Marielle, I hope this day finds you well...

00:05:29.730 --> 00:05:32.560
Deflotte sounds so uncomfortable <i>moru</i> .

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:34.900
Yeah. He didn't know it,

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:39.060
but he has been treating a princess
with terrible rudeness all this time.

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:41.730
Now then, Princess Marielle,

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:43.600
what would you like to do with this man,

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:46.770
who has been as faithless
and irreverent toward you

00:05:46.770 --> 00:05:48.940
as he could possibly be?

00:05:48.940 --> 00:05:52.440
Yes indeed. I'm going to have to punish you.

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:55.230
Wha--?! What are you gonna do to me?

00:05:57.230 --> 00:05:59.520
Deflotte Danois, I hereby order you,

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:01.600
as punishment for all of your disrespect up to now,

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:05.600
to serve me as a knight and
join Alfred in protecting me.

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:06.940
Huh...?

00:06:06.940 --> 00:06:13.730
Ha! Well, there you have it.
You've just been invested as a knight.

00:06:13.730 --> 00:06:17.190
That means that you are not
allowed to run away from me.

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:23.850
Henceforth, as before, you are still my dear friend.

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:27.020
Princess Marielle...

00:06:29.690 --> 00:06:32.440
I hereby accept your order.

00:06:32.440 --> 00:06:36.650
I, Deflotte Danois, pledge to
keep you safe no matter what!

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:40.600
<i>Moru</i> !

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:45.400
You know, Deflotte, the way the kingdom is now,

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:47.150
your investiture doesn't mean much.

00:06:47.150 --> 00:06:50.310
You have to fight in the battle that's
about to begin for all you're worth.

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:54.100
Of course I will! I don't care if
we are facing the Orthodox Church,

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:56.730
I won't let anyone hurt the princess!

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:56.730
Excuse me!

00:06:56.730 --> 00:06:59.400
Yeah, that's the spirit, all right.

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:01.940
So, when do we leave?

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:00.810
Um...

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:04.190
We're waiting to hear from Olivier.

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:03.310
Excuse me!

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:06.940
Yes! I'm ready to go anytime!

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:08.190
Um, excuse me!

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:09.520
Excuse me!

00:07:10.060 --> 00:07:12.770
I am coming with all of you, too!

00:07:12.770 --> 00:07:14.150
Nonnoria...

00:07:14.150 --> 00:07:15.980
What's come over you?

00:07:15.980 --> 00:07:22.020
I have always stayed behind here,
waiting for all of you to return home.

00:07:22.020 --> 00:07:27.440
Beside myself with worry that maybe
you will not be coming back.

00:07:27.440 --> 00:07:31.150
I cannot take waiting alone
for you to return any longer!

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:36.350
But this battle is likely to be on a whole
different level than any before.

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:38.480
I can't guarantee that the supply corps will be safe.

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:40.020
It will be too dangerous for you.

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:49.560
Nonnoria...!

00:07:49.560 --> 00:07:51.480
When did you get so good?

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:56.600
I have been getting archery lessons
from Maurice for a little while.

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:59.350
I can fight alongside the rest of you!

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:04.730
Nonnoria is insisting. Why not?

00:08:04.730 --> 00:08:07.060
Qoo will protect Nonnoria, too <i>moru</i> !

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:12.560
All right, Nonnoria.

00:08:12.560 --> 00:08:14.730
We can use your help.

00:08:14.730 --> 00:08:18.230
Right! Just let me at them!

00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:23.650
Thanks, Nonnoria. But make absolutely
sure that your safety comes first.

00:08:23.650 --> 00:08:27.690
Mm-hmm, Marius--I mean...

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:29.020
Princess Marielle!

00:08:30.850 --> 00:08:33.150
Just stay the course, Nonnoria.

00:08:34.850 --> 00:08:37.650
I'm going to do my best, Marielle!

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:37.650
Look after Nonnoria for me.

00:08:37.650 --> 00:08:39.060
You got it <i>moru</i> !

00:08:40.600 --> 00:08:42.020
Princess Marielle!

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:44.190
I bring a letter from Commander Adelheid!

00:08:49.600 --> 00:08:52.100
Hey, Adelheid!

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:55.060
Why did you summon us way out here?

00:08:55.060 --> 00:08:58.770
Isn't that obvious? She wanted a date with me!

00:08:58.770 --> 00:09:01.440
Isn't that right, Adelheid?

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:05.150
I apologize for troubling you
to come here, Princess Marielle.

00:09:05.150 --> 00:09:06.690
Come on, nothing?

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:10.690
Shouldn't we be wasting no time
in assembling the princess faction lords

00:09:10.690 --> 00:09:13.440
and preparing to go to war?

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:14.730
Yes.

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:16.270
However, before we do...

00:09:17.770 --> 00:09:21.650
Princess Marielle, there is someone
I would like you to meet.

00:09:33.060 --> 00:09:34.150
A child?

00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:38.730
Are you the one that I am supposed to meet?

00:09:42.020 --> 00:09:47.400
Princess Marielle, please forgive
the affront I am about to commit.

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:48.400
Huh?

00:09:55.100 --> 00:09:56.480
What did you do to the princess?!

00:09:56.480 --> 00:09:57.770
Wait.

00:09:57.770 --> 00:10:00.100
She means no harm to the princess.

00:10:03.690 --> 00:10:08.230
Adelheid, who exactly is this young woman?

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:10.980
Lacroix is...

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:15.020
...a witch.

00:10:18.770 --> 00:10:21.980
I knew you'd be in here.

00:10:21.980 --> 00:10:27.350
Everyone is waiting for you.
Come on, let's head in there together...

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:29.480
Marielle.

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:31.350
Yes, Mother.

00:10:44.350 --> 00:10:47.270
Are you sure she is all right?

00:10:47.270 --> 00:10:49.980
I'd ask that you let Lacroix handle this.

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:51.350
Okay...

00:10:51.350 --> 00:10:55.350
So, what do you mean, this girl is a witch?

00:10:55.350 --> 00:10:59.190
I thought witches were just a pretext
the Orthodox Church came up with

00:10:59.190 --> 00:11:02.900
to get rid of those who
were inconvenient for them.

00:11:02.900 --> 00:11:05.900
Yes, I thought so, as well.

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:09.100
Up until I met Lacroix, anyway.

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:14.480
Apparently, she used to travel around
the kingdom on foot selling medicines.

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:18.900
The efficacy of these medicines
were rumored to be almost magical,

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:21.600
and when she drew the attention
of the Orthodox Church,

00:11:21.600 --> 00:11:23.440
she took shelter in Olivier.

00:11:23.440 --> 00:11:27.520
So is a witch someone who makes
powerful medicines, then?

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:32.900
No. Being a healer was a disguise
to conceal my true identity.

00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:35.940
We witches...

00:11:35.940 --> 00:11:37.850
...are Magonian sentinels.

00:11:38.560 --> 00:11:43.060
We possess all knowledge
of the powers of Magonian lore.

00:11:46.230 --> 00:11:50.770
Princess Marielle, happy birthday!

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:55.560
You took your time, didn't you, Marielle?

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:59.600
Everyone has come here to celebrate your birthday.

00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:01.020
Thank you, everyone!

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:07.270
Princess, you are six years old now?

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:15.060
You are becoming as beautiful as
Queen Éléanore with each passing year.

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:19.270
Children really do grow up so quickly, don't they?

00:12:19.270 --> 00:12:24.940
Princess Marielle, my son is training
daily to become a knight.

00:12:24.940 --> 00:12:29.230
Perhaps someday,
he will be assigned to protect you.

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:34.650
Well, in that case, my own daughter,
Adelheid, will not be outdone.

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:37.810
She has become more proficient
with the spear lately,

00:12:37.810 --> 00:12:41.600
and is growing powerful enough
to protect you as well, Princess.

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:43.560
Oh, Father!

00:12:43.560 --> 00:12:47.270
Adelheid, are you going to protect me?

00:12:47.270 --> 00:12:50.730
The honor would be greater
than I deserve, Princess Marielle.

00:12:50.730 --> 00:12:54.270
No matter what happens,
I will stand at your side to keep you safe.

00:12:54.270 --> 00:12:56.730
Isn't that nice, Marielle?

00:12:56.730 --> 00:12:57.730
Mm-hmm.

00:12:58.900 --> 00:13:04.270
I hope days like this one can go on forever.

00:13:04.270 --> 00:13:06.310
Yes, indeed.

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:17.650
I'll watch over Charlot.

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:20.770
So don't cry, Mother.

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:24.270
Thank you, Marielle.

00:13:24.270 --> 00:13:28.560
I am so very happy to have you for a daughter.

00:13:32.980 --> 00:13:35.900
Mother!

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:40.770
Éléanore... Why did you pass on and leave me behind?

00:13:41.730 --> 00:13:44.060
Éléanore!

00:13:46.850 --> 00:13:51.900
Now, Your Majesty, concentrate hard on the relic.

00:13:51.900 --> 00:13:55.650
Your wishes... Your desires...

00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:58.730
What is Father doing, exactly?

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:04.400
The king was trying to bring the queen back to life.

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:07.770
Something capable of making any wish come true--

00:14:07.770 --> 00:14:09.520
That's what the relic is.

00:14:10.560 --> 00:14:13.690
The power of Magonia resides within it.

00:14:13.690 --> 00:14:16.350
The relic...

00:14:16.350 --> 00:14:19.980
I don't know when it first came to be in this world,

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:26.560
but if you can control its great power,
you can realize any wish you please.

00:14:26.560 --> 00:14:32.730
Even raising the dead,
or creating your own ideal word.

00:14:32.730 --> 00:14:35.310
It can do that?

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:40.190
The prior king and Pope Vall D'Hebron acquired the relic,

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:42.770
hoping to acquire knowledge
concerning Magonian powers

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:46.190
in order to fulfill their own appetites,

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:49.230
and were searching for us witches.

00:14:49.230 --> 00:14:51.980
So that's the real story behind the witch hunts?

00:14:51.980 --> 00:14:56.600
Yes. Magonian powers are incredibly vast.

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:59.600
The monsters suddenly appearing
throughout the kingdom

00:14:59.600 --> 00:15:02.230
came about because of Magonian power.

00:15:02.230 --> 00:15:06.980
Also, as a result of the king
becoming fascinated by this power,

00:15:06.980 --> 00:15:10.600
that great tragedy was unleashed.

00:15:10.600 --> 00:15:11.810
Tragedy?

00:15:13.770 --> 00:15:14.850
Princess Marielle!

00:15:15.980 --> 00:15:18.730
Oh, Father...

00:15:32.150 --> 00:15:36.690
If it could be made so that none
of that tragedy ever happened...

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:46.350
If you were to wish upon the relic, even now...

00:15:46.350 --> 00:15:50.560
...you would be able to get back
the world that you wanted.

00:15:52.850 --> 00:15:55.310
Through Magonian power,

00:15:55.310 --> 00:15:58.020
you could lead the world into the future--

00:15:58.020 --> 00:16:01.310
The future where no one was
deprived of their happiness.

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:04.520
The future that should have been.

00:16:11.600 --> 00:16:12.600
Marius...

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:16.600
It's all right.

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:19.350
Knowing you, you can lead even more people,

00:16:19.350 --> 00:16:22.650
and bring about even greater happiness for them.

00:16:22.650 --> 00:16:24.230
Alfred...

00:16:25.980 --> 00:16:29.520
So I want you to light the way
forward for the people,

00:16:29.520 --> 00:16:32.060
and be the flame that leads us into the future.

00:16:34.150 --> 00:16:41.400
Yeah. Right now, I have you, Alfred...
and many other dear friends.

00:16:42.650 --> 00:16:45.900
I am the flame that leads others!

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:49.230
I will not be bewitched by this power!

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:55.060
We will do what needs to be done on our own.

00:17:02.850 --> 00:17:04.020
Princess Marielle!

00:17:04.020 --> 00:17:05.690
She's awake <i>moru</i> !

00:17:06.900 --> 00:17:08.900
Guys...

00:17:08.900 --> 00:17:09.770
Huh?

00:17:09.770 --> 00:17:14.310
Hmm? Oh, sorry! You were tossing
and turning something terrible.

00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:15.940
I-I see...

00:17:20.150 --> 00:17:23.650
I am awfully sorry about that, Princess Marielle.

00:17:23.650 --> 00:17:26.350
That was terribly inappropriate of me.

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:29.310
No, please don't worry about it.

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:32.270
Never mind that, though, where is the relic?

00:17:32.270 --> 00:17:34.600
It is with Vall D'Hebron.

00:17:34.600 --> 00:17:36.350
Sure enough.

00:17:36.350 --> 00:17:40.230
It is extremely dangerous for us
if the pope has that great power.

00:17:40.230 --> 00:17:44.810
Yes. We have to get it away from him.

00:17:44.810 --> 00:17:46.560
Princess Marielle,

00:17:46.560 --> 00:17:51.850
you have passed my trial,
as a sentinel of Magonia.

00:17:51.850 --> 00:17:54.940
I know you that if you
are able to acquire the relic,

00:17:54.940 --> 00:17:59.730
you will not be captivated by its power
and will make the right decisions.

00:17:59.730 --> 00:18:03.520
Yes. I will make sure to prevail
against Pope Vall D'Hebron,

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:06.060
and obtain the relic.

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:08.900
All of you, please lend me your assistance.

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:09.850
--Right!
-- <i>Moru</i> !

00:18:09.850 --> 00:18:10.900
--Yeah!
--Right!

00:18:16.480 --> 00:18:19.520
Now we can start getting ready
to liberate the capital.

00:18:19.520 --> 00:18:23.600
Yes. I invite all of you
to come with me to Olivier.

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:26.600
Oh, yeah! Let's get fired up!

00:18:28.520 --> 00:18:31.100
You called me Marius, huh?

00:18:31.100 --> 00:18:32.350
Eh?

00:18:32.350 --> 00:18:35.900
Back there, you called out to me, right?

00:18:35.900 --> 00:18:36.900
Marius!

00:18:41.350 --> 00:18:46.060
Alfred, I really do want you to call me Marius.

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:53.190
All right, Marius.
But only when no one else is around.

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:54.190
Okay.

00:19:03.730 --> 00:19:04.730
Theresia?

00:19:06.230 --> 00:19:07.850
Rugis!

00:19:07.850 --> 00:19:09.440
Well?

00:19:09.440 --> 00:19:12.310
Sure enough, it looks as though
Princess Marielle and her party

00:19:12.310 --> 00:19:15.980
are going to the capital to take back the relic.

00:19:15.980 --> 00:19:18.400
Also, <i>he</i> will be...

00:19:20.900 --> 00:19:23.810
Rugis, I'm going to the capital, too!

00:19:26.020 --> 00:19:30.350
You've overexerted yourself
with this vision. Remain here.

00:19:31.060 --> 00:19:32.440
But...

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:34.230
I'll take care of it.

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:42.820
November 23, 771, New Holy Era

00:19:39.940 --> 00:19:42.690
Valiant comrades of Hortensia!

00:19:43.020 --> 00:19:48.600
The time has come at last!
Not to usurp, nor to do harm!

00:19:49.270 --> 00:19:50.650
We, the Liberation Army,

00:19:50.650 --> 00:19:55.770
have been raised to protect
and save the people of the kingdom!

00:19:55.770 --> 00:20:04.060
Loyal knights, beloved friends,
I will be the hand that leads you all!

00:20:04.060 --> 00:20:06.520
Follow the brilliance of my sword!

00:20:06.520 --> 00:20:10.600
Before it lies the road
that leads to true peace!

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:12.400
Forward, to battle!

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:18.600
Take the country back from the Orthodox Church!

00:20:18.600 --> 00:20:20.900
In the name of Princess Marielle!

00:20:24.900 --> 00:20:27.480
You surprised me.

00:20:27.480 --> 00:20:31.060
Imagine, Marius being
the actual Princess Marielle!

00:20:31.060 --> 00:20:35.940
Marie, Jim, thanks for joining
with the Liberation Army.

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:37.400
Didn't I tell you?

00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:41.270
Whenever the princess is in trouble,
we'll be sure to come running!

00:20:41.270 --> 00:20:43.440
If there's anything we can do to help you,

00:20:43.440 --> 00:20:46.520
we'll go with you, even into the capital.

00:20:46.520 --> 00:20:50.100
Oh, wow, look how many people we have gathered!

00:20:50.100 --> 00:20:53.400
Yes, no doubt thanks to
Princess Marielle's popularity.

00:20:56.810 --> 00:20:59.940
I don't see Old Man Balthauser here.

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:02.940
Well, I did send him a message,

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:05.690
but there was no reply,
and his whereabouts are unknown.

00:21:05.690 --> 00:21:06.850
What?

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:21.130
December 1, 771, New Holy Era

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:24.150
The Racines River is just up ahead, right?

00:21:24.150 --> 00:21:27.600
Yeah. If the Ecclesiastical Knights
are going to engage us,

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:29.810
that's where they'll be lined up.

00:21:29.810 --> 00:21:32.480
Can I ask you to alert the front line, Deflotte?

00:21:32.480 --> 00:21:34.150
You bet.

00:21:34.150 --> 00:21:35.350
Hey, are those...?

00:21:36.730 --> 00:21:39.060
Camellian troops!

00:21:39.060 --> 00:21:40.650
What is Camellia doing here?

00:21:43.850 --> 00:21:44.850
Was that...?

00:21:46.020 --> 00:21:49.690
When the seeds of strife are so close at hand...

00:21:49.690 --> 00:21:53.230
...it would be a waste to just
stand around and watch.

00:21:53.230 --> 00:21:55.520
Let's destroy, maim...

00:21:55.520 --> 00:21:57.190
...and kill each other.

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:02.090
Chapter 9

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:02.090
The Witch

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:02.090
~A Trial into the Past~

00:23:33.560 --> 00:23:34.940
Stop this, both of you!

00:23:34.940 --> 00:23:35.770
Don't push it.

00:23:35.770 --> 00:23:37.980
So the Orthodox Church has these.

00:23:37.980 --> 00:23:41.230
It really feels like some kind
of fate is at work here.

00:23:41.230 --> 00:23:42.730
I'll be counting on you.

00:23:42.730 --> 00:23:43.940
Alfred Albert...

00:23:43.940 --> 00:23:46.940
Alfred Albert...

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:47.070
Chapter 10

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:47.070
Showdown

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:47.070
~The March to Liberation~
